Name:Rules pilot 381 - Target the Image
Goal:Win
Turns:1
Difficulty:Hard
Description:It is your second main phase. You have Phantasmal Image and Shock in hand, with two blue and one red mana floating. The opponent is at 5 life and controls an untapped Kokusho, the Evening Star. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-phantasmal-target-sacrifice | Phantasmal Image copies Kokusho, dies trigger included (CR 707.2), and gains "when this becomes the target of a spell or ability, sacrifice it": Shock aimed at your own Image makes you sacrifice it before Shock resolves, and your Kokusho copy's dies trigger drains 5 (CR 603.10a); Shock to the face deals only 2 and Kokusho is too big for it
